# Sprint Plan: Orchid Squad

> **Sprint Duration**: 10 days  
> **Markers**: INVEST-READY | SPRINT-CAPACITY-90 | DASHBOARD-RELEASE-Q2

---

## Sprint Goal

**Improve dashboard usefulness and reduce support friction**

Deliver core dashboard functionality with export capability and admin audit visibility, enabling users to track progress and administrators to review sensitive actions without requiring support intervention.

---

## Team Capacity Calculation

| Metric | Value |
|--------|-------|
| Base Velocity | 30 points |
| Availability Factor | 0.9 |
| **Adjusted Capacity** | **27 points** |
| 85% Commitment Threshold | 23 points |

**Formula**: `30 × 0.9 = 27 points`  
**Committed Load Target**: ≤ 23 points (85% of adjusted capacity)

---

## Committed Stories

| ID | Title | Points | Priority |
|-----|-------|--------|----------|
| US-101 | View key dashboard metrics | 5 | High |
| US-102 | Export dashboard summary to CSV | 3 | High |
| US-105 | Admin audit log overview | 5 | High |
| US-103 | Add dashboard filters by date range | 5 | Medium |
| US-106 | Enable instant search caching | 3 | Low |

### **Committed Story Points: 21 / 27 (78% of capacity)**

---

## Stretch Stories

| ID | Title | Points | Priority |
|-----|-------|--------|----------|
| US-104 | Improve search performance | 8 | Medium |

### **Stretch Story Points: 8**

> If capacity allows, US-104 can be pulled into the sprint. Total with stretch: 29 points (107% of adjusted capacity).

---

## Acceptance Criteria & INVEST Validation

### US-101: View key dashboard metrics (5pts)

**Acceptance Criteria**:
- Given the user has access, when they open the dashboard, then key metrics are visible.
- Given data is unavailable, when the dashboard loads, then a friendly empty state is shown.
- Given the dashboard is opened, when the content renders, then it completes within 2 seconds.

**INVEST Validation**:
- ✅ **Independent**: No dependencies on other stories.
- ✅ **Valuable**: Delivers direct user benefit (progress tracking).
- ✅ **Testable**: Clear Gherkin-style criteria with measurable thresholds.

---

### US-102: Export dashboard summary to CSV (3pts)

**Acceptance Criteria**:
- Given the user has visible metrics, when they click export, then a CSV download starts.
- Given export fails, when the system responds with an error, then a clear message is shown.
- Given a file is generated, when the export completes, then the filename includes the current date.

**INVEST Validation**:
- ✅ **Independent**: Can be built after US-101 without blocking.
- ✅ **Negotiable**: Export format and filename convention can be refined.
- ✅ **Testable**: Download behavior and error states are verifiable.

---

### US-105: Admin audit log overview (5pts)

**Acceptance Criteria**:
- Given an admin opens the page, when the audit log loads, then the latest actions are displayed.
- Given no records exist, when the page is opened, then an empty state appears.
- Given the admin filters by action type, when results return, then only matching events are shown.

**INVEST Validation**:
- ✅ **Independent**: Separate feature area from dashboard metrics.
- ✅ **Valuable**: Enables admin oversight and compliance tracking.
- ✅ **Testable**: Filter behavior and empty states are clearly defined.

---

### US-103: Add dashboard filters by date range (5pts)

**Acceptance Criteria**:
- Given the user is on the dashboard, when they choose a date range, then the metrics update.
- Given an invalid range is selected, when the form is submitted, then validation is displayed.
- Given filters are applied, when the page refreshes, then the selection is preserved.

**INVEST Validation**:
- ✅ **Valuable**: Enables focused activity review.
- ✅ **Estimable**: Scope is bounded to date range filtering.
- ✅ **Testable**: Validation and state persistence are testable.

---

### US-106: Enable instant search caching (3pts)

**Acceptance Criteria**:
- Given the cache is warm, when the same search repeats, then the cached response is used.
- Given cache data expires, when a new request arrives, then fresh results are fetched.
- Given caching is unavailable, when the feature runs, then search still works without errors.

**INVEST Validation**:
- ✅ **Independent**: Backend optimization with no UI dependencies.
- ✅ **Small**: Focused on caching layer only.
- ✅ **Testable**: Cache hit/miss and fallback behavior are verifiable.

---

## Summary

| Category | Stories | Points | % of Capacity |
|----------|---------|--------|---------------|
| Committed | 5 | 21 | 78% |
| Stretch | 1 | 8 | 30% |
| **Total Available** | **6** | **29** | **107%** |

**Committed load (21pts) is within the 85% threshold (23pts).**  
Stretch item US-104 can be considered if early delivery occurs.

---

